    },
    "body": "A card selected without AID, such as a SAM selected by its power-on data, could not exchange any APDU (\"Channel is not open\"): the Keyple service only calls openChannelForAid() when an AID is set, so no OMAPI channel was opened. The basic channel is now opened on the first transmission.\n\nAlso close the OMAPI session when closing the physical channel, even if no channel was opened.",
